# CASM Phase 14 WP89 trusted reference: casmloc7
#
# Independently hand-assembled from the casmloc7 fixture source in
# cmake/GenerateCasmTestFixtures.cmake. NOT produced by CASM. Proves a
# @local (@LOOP) and a global (LOOP) whose spellings match apart from the
# '@' are distinct symbols: JMP LOOP and JMP @LOOP resolve to different
# absolute addresses.
#
# Source (.ORG $C000, fixed address):
#   | .ORG $C000
#   | LOOP:
#   |     NOP
#   | @LOOP:
#   |     JMP LOOP
#   |     JMP @LOOP
#
# Hand assembly:
#   00 C0        - PRG load-address header
#   EA           - LOOP NOP at $C000
#   4C 00 C0     - @LOOP JMP LOOP at $C001 targeting $C000
#   4C 01 C0     - JMP @LOOP at $C004 targeting $C001
#
# bytes: 9

00 C0
EA
4C 00 C0
4C 01 C0
